# Vercel CLI deploys (`vercel deploy`) upload the local working tree directly —
# unlike a Git-triggered deployment, they do NOT automatically respect
# .gitignore. Without this file, a CLI deploy bundles local secrets/PII that
# must never leave this machine as plain files. Mirrors the sensitive-data
# exclusions in .gitignore.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Phase 4.6 — real maid biodata is sensitive personal data; the local-only
# import input (source PDFs, extracted-data JSON) must never be uploaded.
private-import-data/
*.biodata.pdf
public/*.pdf

# Local tooling directories that have nothing to do with the deployed app.
.claude/
.vercel/
